Third-party components
----------------------
JNUScout builds on external open-source and academic software.  None of the
components below are bundled with this distribution; each remains under its
own license and must be installed separately:

- SCINE (Chemoton, Puffin, ReaDuct, scine_utilities, scine_database)
  https://scine.ethz.ch/
- MACE (mace-torch)                     https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace
- AIMNet2                               https://github.com/isayevlab/aimnet2
- Atomic Simulation Environment (ASE)   https://ase-lib.org/
- ORCA quantum chemistry program        (external, academic license)
- xtb / GFN2-xTB                        (external executable)

The full text of the Apache License 2.0 is in the LICENSE file.
